    ^{:line 54 :tag writeFramer :doc "write is the interface value that does the writing, once the\nWriteScheduler has selected this frame to write. The write\nfunctions are all defined in write.go.\n"} write




    ^{:line 59 :tag (* stream) :doc "stream is the stream on which this frame will be written.\nnil for non-stream frames like PING and SETTINGS.\nnil for RST_STREAM streams, which use the StreamError.StreamID field instead.\n"} stream




